    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/6021050b0ba51fc7b7b74091cc1d10a7.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are either the target or pursuer, or both... Find your target without being detected by other players. Distinguish who is real vs who is an NPC.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use defensive abilities to trick players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use interactive environment props like gates to escape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/2eb60b7831ac07dbbc202fa03d16f890.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in or go rouge, the choice is yours.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use offensive abilities to track down your target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the map and gain the high ground</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful as you may reveal your position</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/39bf9b4925b0d6a450c6f5fd75b444fa.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and collect hints. Be on the lookout for visual and audio cues. Check your map for intel on you target's whereabouts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds scattered across the map that reveal last known target location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target portrait lights up when in line of sight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/2d457d46a28c1d92aadb83b6ba5da350.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combination of offensive and defensive abilities to gain the upper hand.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged Attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warp</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 VS 1</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 VS 4</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/6021050b0ba51fc7b7b74091cc1d10a7.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are either the target or pursuer, or both... Find your target without being detected by other players. Distinguish who is real vs who is an NPC.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use defensive abilities to trick players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use interactive environment props like gates to escape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/2eb60b7831ac07dbbc202fa03d16f890.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in or go rouge, the choice is yours.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use offensive abilities to track down your target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the map and gain the high ground</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful as you may reveal your position</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/39bf9b4925b0d6a450c6f5fd75b444fa.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and collect hints. Be on the lookout for visual and audio cues. Check your map for intel on you target's whereabouts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds scattered across the map that reveal last known target location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target portrait lights up when in line of sight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359650/extras/2d457d46a28c1d92aadb83b6ba5da350.avif?t=1744588173\" width=586 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combination of offensive and defensive abilities to gain the upper hand.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged Attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warp</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 VS 1</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 VS 4</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stealth Tag is a 1-4 player social deduction game that blends fast-paced action with clever strategy. Outsmart your pursuers, track down your target, and master a variety of abilities to tip the scales in your favor. Rely on stealth, cunning, and quick thinking to rack up your score.",
